                  "model_provider_unavailable"
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "Why a failed run failed, as a stable code to branch on; `error` carries the copy for a human. Null unless the run failed and Martini can name the cause. `model_provider_unavailable`: the AI model provider (Anthropic) kept failing or could not be reached, so the run stopped. The workflow and its inputs did not cause it: start the run again."
          },
          "engine": {
            "description": "Which engine drives the run.",
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "fable",
              "harness"
            ]
          },
          "compile": {
            "description": "True for a script build, which generates no media.",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "thenRunId": {
            "description": "Present only when a build will automatically start execution. Null until handoff: keep polling this build, including after completed, until the execution id appears. Then poll /v1/runs/{thenRunId} for media results. Absent for build-only requests.",
